                                        "entry_id": "28303228-8339-3dcb-8f44-940676b34a9b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A program under which the United States supplied the United Kingdom (and British Commonwealth), Free France, the Republic of China, and later the Soviet Union and other Allied nations with food, oil, and materiel between 1941 and August 1945."
